  "description": "Pure managed image loading and saving for Aardvark PixImages and plain images: PNG, JPEG, TIFF, GIF, OpenEXR, WebP, JPEG 2000, BMP, TGA, DDS, KTX, Radiance HDR, PNM, QOI, ICO, with metadata, ICC colour management and image operations. No native code.",
