  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First release: pure managed decoders and encoders for PNG, JPEG, TIFF, GIF, OpenEXR, WebP, JPEG 2000, JBIG, BMP, TGA, DDS, KTX, Radiance HDR, PNM, QOI and ICO, LERC decode only.\nAardvark loader `Aardvark.Data.PixCodec` with PixImage, mip map, cube map and volume loading and saving.\nMetadata (EXIF, XMP, GPS, ICC) readable without decoding the image, lossless metadata writing, ICC colour management, resizing and other image operations.",
